					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051027,
					"content": "「轉告所有黑蛇騎士，不論如何，守護好坎瑞亞的人民。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051028
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051028,
					"content": "誠然，我們有著「宮廷衛隊」的頭銜。但面對那種浩劫，王室、名流、平民…這些身分都已經失去意義。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051029
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051029,
					"content": "面對神明之力，大地上只存在「坎瑞亞人」這一身分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051030
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051030,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051031
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051031,
					"content": "或許在這些已經失去理智的黑蛇騎士心中，他們依然在為守護坎瑞亞人民而戰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051032,
					"content": "將這座遺蹟視為災難中的坎瑞亞，將那些丘丘人視為正在求助的民眾…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051033
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051033,
					"content": "正如我所聽到的…他們口中不斷嘶吼的，絕非是對他人的警告。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051034,
					"content": "那…他們說的是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051035
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051035,
					"content": "儘管已經很難辨別，但我聽得出，那是古坎瑞亞語的「快逃」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051036,
						80051037
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051036,
					"content": "他們並非是在對我們說話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051038
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051038,
					"content": "就算是我也不得不承認，這份意志如此頑強，經歷了五百年時光都未被磨滅…算得上是誕生自絕望的奇蹟了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051039
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051039,
					"content": "那、那我不是誤會他們了嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051040
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051040,
					"content": "沒什麼。即使是我，也有那麼一瞬間將他們視為敵人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051041
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051041,
					"content": "朝著上面有光亮的地方繼續前進吧，黑蛇騎士們應該不會阻止我們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051037,
					"content": "是在叫身後的丘丘人快逃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051038
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051013,
					"content": "這種戰鬥沒有意義。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051006,
					"content": "「結局」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051007
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800514,
			"completionStepIds": [
				800514
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"800514",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 800514,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80051401,
					"content": "欸，這個房間沒有門阻擋，看來終於可以前往中間的那個房間了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051402,
					"content": "我們快過去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800515,
			"completionStepIds": [
				800515
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"800515",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 800515,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80051501,
					"content": "快看頭頂上，居然有個水池！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051502,
					"content": "連池水都是倒置的，還真是奇景。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051503,
					"content": "你知道這個水池是怎麼回事嗎，戴因？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051504,
					"content": "水池似乎和整座城市是一體的，想必也是古文明的遺留物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051505,
					"content": "關鍵在於…我認為，削弱詛咒的效果便是來自於它。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051506,
					"content": "身處此地，軀體便會感覺到前所未有的寧靜。感覺比之前更強烈了，我想多半是因為那池水有著類似「淨化」的效果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051507,
					"content": "「淨化」？那會不會…那個水池裡的水可以徹底將詛咒淨化掉呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051508,
					"content": "不可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051509,
					"content": "那麼肯定？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051510,
					"content": "我保持著清醒與詛咒共存至今，已有五百年。沒人比我更清楚有關詛咒的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051511,
					"content": "它是這個世界的因果級別的烙印，神明的詛咒甚至從位格上高於人類本身。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051512,
					"content": "我能感覺到，詛咒正在不斷滲透我的一切，成為我的一部分，甚至逐漸「取代」我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051513,
					"content": "有限地抑制詛咒侵蝕或許還有可能，至於淨化…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051514,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}就想像成直接焚毀掉身體的某一部分好了。在那之前，{F#妳}{M#你}甚至無法保住性命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051515,
					"content": "啊？！那不就要一命嗚呼了嗎！怎麼會這樣…無法淨化的詛咒…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051516,
					"content": "從這裡感受到的池水，其淨化效力還差得很遠。只能勉強起到一些抑制詛咒的作用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051517,
					"content": "那下面這個裝置又是什麼呢？好像跟周圍有些格格不入…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051518,
						80051519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051518,
					"content": "莫非是深淵教團的東西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051520,
					"content": "#坦白說，我也沒見過這種構造的裝置。{F#妳}{M#你}認為是深淵教團放置的，不無道理。莫非，他們是在做什麼準備…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051521,
					"content": "（咔啦咔啦…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "調查"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051522,
					"content": "嗚哇！嚇我一跳，周圍那些大門都被打開了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051523,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈夫丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051524,
					"content": "呀，是那個叫哈夫丹的騎士…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051525,
					"content": "你有話要對我說嗎？哈夫丹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051526,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈夫丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051527,
					"content": "他走了…可是這次不是突然消失的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051528,
					"content": "#是在示意我們跟隨他。如何，{F#妳}{M#你}們要來嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051529,
						80051530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051529,
					"content": "可能是新的線索。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051531
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051531,
					"content": "說的也是…那…我們走吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051530,
					"content": "他應該對我們沒有惡意了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051531
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051519,
					"content": "可能是深淵教團的秘密了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051520
					]
				}
			]
		},
