				{
					"id": 80051513,
					"content": "有限地抑制詛咒侵蝕或許還有可能，至於淨化…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051514,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}就想像成直接焚毀掉身體的某一部分好了。在那之前，{F#妳}{M#你}甚至無法保住性命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051515,
					"content": "啊？！那不就要一命嗚呼了嗎！怎麼會這樣…無法淨化的詛咒…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051516,
					"content": "從這裡感受到的池水，其淨化效力還差得很遠。只能勉強起到一些抑制詛咒的作用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051517,
					"content": "那下面這個裝置又是什麼呢？好像跟周圍有些格格不入…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051518,
						80051519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051518,
					"content": "莫非是深淵教團的東西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051520,
					"content": "#坦白說，我也沒見過這種構造的裝置。{F#妳}{M#你}認為是深淵教團放置的，不無道理。莫非，他們是在做什麼準備…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051521,
					"content": "（咔啦咔啦…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "調查"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051522,
					"content": "嗚哇！嚇我一跳，周圍那些大門都被打開了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051523,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈夫丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051524,
					"content": "呀，是那個叫哈夫丹的騎士…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051525,
					"content": "你有話要對我說嗎？哈夫丹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051526,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈夫丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051527,
					"content": "他走了…可是這次不是突然消失的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051528,
					"content": "#是在示意我們跟隨他。如何，{F#妳}{M#你}們要來嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051529,
						80051530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051529,
					"content": "可能是新的線索。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051531
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051531,
					"content": "說的也是…那…我們走吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80051530,
					"content": "他應該對我們沒有惡意了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051531
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80051519,
					"content": "可能是深淵教團的秘密了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80051520
					]
				}
			]
		},
